  "title": "Orissa High Court dismisses Vedanta's plea to enforce 2004 bauxite supply agreement",
  "summary": "The Orissa High Court dismissed Vedanta's plea to enforce a 2004 bauxite supply agreement, citing the inability to revive old agreements after participation in a new policy. The ruling highlights the court's focus on public trust and the importance of natural resource rights.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Orissa High Court dismissed Vedanta's plea to enforce a 2004 bauxite supply agreement.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The court held that promissory estoppel cannot compel the state to act against mining law or confer a commercial right over natural resources.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The case was initiated under the amended long-term linkage policy for bauxite.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
